#define HELP_STRING "Controls/options:\n\t*File:\n\t\t-Ctrl-O: Open a pdf document\n\t\t-Ctrl-Q: Quit (preferences will be saved)\n\n\t*Fullscreen:\n\t\t-Ctrl-F: Fullscreen mode on/off\n\n\t*Reading mode:\n\t\t-p: Switch to Page mode: only the full pages are displayed\n\t\t-s: Switch to Strip mode: display in strips mode, based on window/page width\n\t\t-c: Switch to Panel (square) mode: display each panel of the comics individually\nwhen possible\n\t\t-Page preview: Display a preview of the full page when in Panel/Strip mode,\nallowing to preview the whole page before reading in details\n\t\t-Ctrl-P: Show/hide the page thumbnails view (full page view on the side)\n\n\t*Navigation:\n\t\t-Left arrow: Go to previous case/previous strip (to previous page in Page mode)\n\t\t-Right arrow: Go to next case/next strip (to next page in Page mode)\n\t\t-Bottom arrow: Go to previous page\n\t\t-Top arrow: Go to next page\n\t\t-Mouse wheel up: Go to previous case/strip/page\n\t\t-Mouse wheel down: Go to next case/strip/page\n\n"
